":"Carmen Machi","role":"Enfermera jefe","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlyC5BuoLBUAX0M4bDY24fbT1MI.jpg"},{"id":952,"name":"Agustín Almodóvar","role":"Cura","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ciY5icxyNekGwD3taLvzOprp2w5.jpg"},{"id":4368,"name":"Carlos García Cambero","role":"Cuñado de Lydia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Wb0Zw6pMWRVVoQKtPNuuiHqGkg.jpg"},{"id":93,"name":"Esther García","role":"Oficial","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8PwXzbOqw4JpR7rdclv4a7HpACg.jpg"},{"id":1651930,"name":"Lola García","role":"Recepcionista Hospital"},{"id":1356494,"name":"Fernando Iglesias","role":"Swimmer (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/icj86ValRJ7xrdb7CcvK635SBBc.jpg"},{"id":954,"name":"Marisa Paredes","role":"Espectadora (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/71esuRUCyeSyib35mTFPkR24zH7.jpg"},{"id":953,"name":"Cecilia Roth","role":"Espectadora (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4icHsZvHy0ZnDGF2kovjNLuDQEM.jpg"},{"id":6536,"name":"Loles León","role":"Talk show host","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tGzS0iV3K4fTGIiOb1UJRpMOL8u.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Parla con lei","overview":"Strani scherzi del destino. Marco e Benigno, due spettatori della pièce teatrale Café Muller si sfiorano con gli occhi, coinvolti nella stessa commozione. Si ritrovano qualche mese dopo nella clinica dove Benigno lavora come infermiere. Marco è lì per accudire la fidanzata in coma..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Talk to Her","overview":"Two men share an odd friendship while they care for two women who are both in deep comas."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"Hable con ella","overview":"Benigno, un enfermero, y Marco, un escritor maduro, coinciden en un espectáculo de Pina Bausch, en el Cafe Müller. En el escenario, dos mujeres con los ojos cerrados y los brazos extendidos se mueven al compás de \"The Fairy Queen\" de Henry Purcell. La emoción de Marco es tal que rompe a llorar. A Benigno le gustaría decirle que a él también le emociona el espectáculo, pero no se atreve. Meses más tarde, los dos hombres vuelven a encontrarse en la clínica privada \"El Bosque\", donde Benigno trabaja. Lydia, la novia de Marco, torera de profesión, ha sufrido una cogida y está en coma. Benigno cuida de otra mujer también en estado de coma: Alicia, una estudiante de ballet. El reencuentro entre Marco y Benigno es el comienzo de una intensa amistad. Dentro de la clínica, la vida de los cuatro personajes fluye en todas las direcciones, pasado, presente y futuro, arrastrando a los cuatro a un destino insospechado."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ohnunWwTfPsqiixTPbGQP4kyUzc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rknvDtxOe1uqLX0EFWLHIQxRXcJ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":64,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ohnunWwTfPsqiixTPbGQP4kyUzc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ohnunWwTfPsqiixTPbGQP4kyUzc.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ohnunWwTfPsqiixTPbGQP4kyUzc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ohnunWwTfPsqiixTPbGQP4kyUzc.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qmYuurquPqlzAkJevk9cFmu40U9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qmYuurquPqlzAkJevk9cFmu40U9.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uO1fEZrkYsrOzw2yOENkdr5KJOx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uO1fEZrkYsrOzw2yOENkdr5KJOx.jpg","language":"it","width":1